        "id": "4e0635ad-eda7-4567-895f-9d814c4fce07",
        "name": "Lanu",
        "arcs": [
            {
                "id": "33c010bd-eb2d-4d83-9ee5-40bb975500a4",
                "name": "Arc 1: Thyrous",
                "parts": [
                    {
                        "id": "b5402fea-fb85-41dd-b488-d2a377b6ef23",
                        "name": "Part 1: Arrival",
                        "details": [
                            {
                                "id": "229f2732-2510-471b-a526-a2faf1bc2b12",
                                "name": "Script",
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "As the party approaches Thyrous, they notice several villagers gathered near the edge of town. They appear impatient and keep looking toward the forest.\nA slim wood elf approaches the party. Her name is Chandra.\nChandra grabs one of the party members by the arm, welcomes them to Thyrous, and takes them to her office.\n\nChandra explains:\nLanu contains many towns like Thyrous.\nThese towns move with the plants and animals of the forest.\nTheir survival depends on the forest.\nSomething has recently gone wrong.\nCommunications between towns stopped working a couple of weeks ago.\nYesterday, Thyrous sent its local blacksmith, Kellan Ironroot, toward the nearest core. He never returned.\nThe villagers sent a distress call, which brought the party to Thyrous.\n\nThe Eleven Cores\nChandra explains that there are eleven magical cores throughout Lanu.\nOne central core.\nTen scattered throughout the forest.\nThe cores were established by druids long ago when Lanu was created.\nThe Assignment\nChandra asks the party to:\nFind Kellan Ironroot.\nInvestigate the nearest core.\nReport what they discover.\nThe party is asked to leave first thing tomorrow.\n\n\n\n",
                                "width": 400,
                                "height": 300
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "id": "e38e5a19-079a-4e4e-9acd-73a2c1efdf1e",
                        "name": "Part 2: Kellan",
                        "details": [
                            {
                                "id": "2fd4b1cc-b354-48ad-b516-347b4abfc057",
                                "name": "Script",
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "The party leaves Thyrous and travels through the forest.\nAfter traveling through the forest and following Kellan's trail, the party eventually finds him.\nKellan has a broken leg caused by a branch striking him. He is also running low on food.\nThe party needs to help him return to Thyrous. They can heal him or carry/help him back.\nKellan's Account\nAfter returning to Thyrous, Kellan explains what happened:\nThe forest initially looked healthy.\nHe noticed mysterious people setting up camps.\nDuring the night, the forest attacked him.\nA branch struck him and broke his leg.\nHe never reached the core.\nKellan does not have firsthand information about what happened to the core.\n",
                                "width": 400,
                                "height": 300
                            },
